'''Empress Chronos''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 7.3 Update|Version 7.3]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties The Majestic Zeus]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]] gains Immune to Warp and increases health and attack power. [[Talents]] were also added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]].

