==Trivia==
*Chronos the Infinite's Japanese name, Chronos Trigger, is a direct reference to the role-playing game ''Chrono Trigger''.
*Not to be confused with [[wikipedia:Cronus|Cronus/Kronos]] the titan god, [[wikipedia:Chronos|Chronos]] is the personification of time, hence explaining the unit's time-themed animations and Freeze ability.

